---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Report an incident" description="Tell UnPoison about pesticide spraying, misuse, exposure or poisoning and find urgent poison-information support.">
  <header class="page-hero shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-current="page">Report an incident</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Spraying, exposure or poisoning</p>
    <h1>Report an incident</h1>
    <p class="lede">If you witnessed pesticide misuse, unsafe spraying, contamination, exposure or poisoning, your account can help show where policy and enforcement are failing.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="section-compact section-rule">
    <div class="shell article-grid">
      <article class="article-body">
        <h2>What to tell us first</h2>
        <p>Send a short description of what happened, when and where it happened, and the best way to contact you. If you know the product or substance involved, include its name. Photos may help, but do not put yourself at risk to collect evidence.</p>
        <p>Please avoid sending medical records, identity documents or other people's personal information in your first email. We will discuss what further detail is useful and how to share it.</p>
        <h2>What happens next</h2>
        <p>Our team will review your message and respond as capacity allows. Reporting to UnPoison does not replace a report to a health professional, emergency service or responsible authority. We cannot provide emergency medical care.</p>
        <div class="notice">
          <p><strong>Possible poisoning or urgent exposure?</strong> Seek medical help promptly. The South African Poisons Information Helpline is <a href="tel:0861555777">0861 555 777</a>. It is listed by the <a href="https://health.uct.ac.za/department-paediatrics/clinical-services-medical-services/poisons-information-centre">University of Cape Town Poisons Information Centre</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <aside class="article-aside">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact the team</p>
        <h3>Tell us about an incident</h3>
        <p>Start with a brief email. We will advise on the next step and any supporting information we need.</p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:unpoisonsa@gmail.com?subject=Incident%20reporting%20enquiry">Email UnPoison</a>
        <p class="fine-print">Read our <a href="/privacy/">privacy information</a> before sharing personal details. This inbox is not monitored as an emergency channel.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
